# Emry: "{T}: Choose target artifact card in your graveyard. You may cast that card this turn." Turn 1: Black Lotus pays {U}{U}{U}
# for Emry, whose enters ability mills Lightning Bolt, Mox Jet and two Islands; the sacrificed Lotus is in the graveyard too.
#
# Turn 3: Bot1 activates Emry on Mox Jet and does not cast it. Turn 5: with the grant long gone the Mox Jet cannot be cast (a refusal),
# so the grant lasted only "this turn" (CR 611.2a). Bot1 activates Emry again, and now the Mox Jet can be cast - but the Black Lotus
# still cannot, since only the chosen card was granted - and it comes onto the battlefield from the graveyard.

